  "body": "Currently the rel=\"noopener\" keyword indicates that new browsing contexts which result from following the hyperlink will not have an opener browsing context, however, if the navigation would normally preserve the browsing context, nothing changes.\n\nIt would be nice to be able to get a new independent browsing context without leaving the current browser window, by allowing <a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_top\"> to cause a new browsing context to be created, simply re-using the browsing window.\n",
